<div class="loading-container">
    <div class="loading-content">
        <div class="loading-spinner"></div>
        <h2>系統設置中</h2>
        <p>請稍候，我們正在為您創建專屬系統...</p>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
.loading-container {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--background-color);
}

.loading-content {
    text-align: center;
}

.loading-spinner {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    border: 5px solid #f3f3f3;
    border-top: 5px solid var(--primary-color);
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes spin {
    0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
    100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}

.loading-content h2 {
    color: var(--text-color);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.loading-content p {
    color: #666;
}
</style>

<script>
// 5秒後自動跳轉到客戶的集點卡頁面
setTimeout(() => {
    window.location.href = '/<%= slugname %>/card';
}, 5000);
</script> 